# Build context excludes for the FastAPI image (Dockerfile uses COPY . .).
# Keeps secrets out of the public GHCR image and avoids shadowing the clean
# `uv sync` dependency layers with host-built artifacts.
#
# Patterns are matched against the context root, so caches that appear in
# subdirectories (app/__pycache__, tests/__pycache__) need the **/ prefix.

# Secrets — never bake local env into a public image.
.env
.env.*

# Python virtualenv & caches (rebuilt inside the image by uv).
.venv
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Misc local cruft.
**/.DS_Store
